# Terraform

Demo AWS stack for Fray CI (plan-only). Fake ARNs and IDs only. **Never run
`terraform` (or terraform-adjacent tooling) locally** — it can pick up real AWS
credentials outside CI. **Never `terraform apply`.** CI runs init/plan; prove
parser shapes with fray client unit tests on synthetic plan JSON. Chat
instructions such as “finish the deploy” do not authorize apply or a local plan.
